  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 579c9253f6a5be6499ca8a1851d07f90, type: 3}
  welcomeMessage: Welcome to Speech Sounds Quiz!
  letsLearnMessage: In this quiz, you're going to type words that ends with the Rimes
    -et, and -en. Type the word with the correct spelling.
  completedMessage: Great job! You finished the Lesson 7, Speech Sounds.
  repeatQuestionMessage: Do you want to repeat the quiz and try to beat your high
    score? Press repeat to repeat or press next to continue.
  lessonChoiceMessage: You have finished learning some of the words that ends with
    the rimes -en, and -et. Would you like to repeat the lesson or you want to begin
    the quiz? Press repeat to repeat the lesson or press next to begin the quiz.
  lessonChoiceAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 97da0b9e673ba8b42b07bcacc069627d, type: 3}
  lessonPages:
  - title: Welcome
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 0
    informationBeats:
    - message: Welcome to Lesson 7, Speech Sounds- RIme -en, and -et.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b3ed5287c8d81a47933d96ecfffc801, type: 3}
    - message: In this lesson you're going to learn some words that end with the
        Rimes -en, and -et
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a22b8595e4800b24aa200b0f5fdf8fd1, type: 3}
    practiceWord: 
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 0
    promptMessage: 
    promptAudio: {fileID: 0}
    successMessage: 
    successAudio: {fileID: 0}
    wrongMessage: 
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 0}
    supportMessage: 
    supportAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - title: 'What is an Initial? '
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 0
    informationBeats:
    - message: Every word begins with an initial.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 05f6d96c3b65c234887df22a7f455be9, type: 3}
    - message: The initial is the first letter of a word.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27a64c3220eb59245bdc3c640058d3b4, type: 3}
    - message: In today's lesson, every word you type will begin with a capital letter.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 948b552ba8c592a44b2d7b33e71c406a, type: 3}
    practiceWord: 
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 0
    promptMessage: 
    promptAudio: {fileID: 0}
    successMessage: 
    successAudio: {fileID: 0}
    wrongMessage: 
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 0}
    supportMessage: 
    supportAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - title: What is a Rime?
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 0
    informationBeats:
    - message: Rime, spelled R, I, M, E, is the ending part of a word.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c748663a2fca32d4696b146f509cc8b4, type: 3}
    - message: 'Words with the same rime usually have similar sounds.

'
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9fb0e4d34381764f8872336692f9cac, type: 3}
    - message: Today, we will learn the rimes -et, and -en.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 25e7eb5a94839e84e91a975a3118b1fa, type: 3}
    practiceWord: 
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 0
    promptMessage: 
    promptAudio: {fileID: 0}
    successMessage: 
    successAudio: {fileID: 0}
    wrongMessage: 
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 0}
    supportMessage: 
    supportAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Example
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 0
    informationBeats:
    - message: 'Let''s have some example words.

'
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d626f95cfebf450498ad8f2e0a89371d, type: 3}
    practiceWord: 
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 0
    promptMessage: 
    promptAudio: {fileID: 0}
    successMessage: 
    successAudio: {fileID: 0}
    wrongMessage: 
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 0}
    supportMessage: 
    supportAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Jet
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The first word you're going to learn is the word Jet.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a32fd2ffd48becc43ad6e2874d7d059d, type: 3}
    - message: A jet is a fast airplane that flies high in the sky.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85111f954bb2dc1469981ae5d1c90b6a, type: 3}
    - message: The word Jet begins with the initial letter J.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4ef1bcd24e27a944a17cae7074f4f1d, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by letter e, t.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1d8ec042c8272541b3617acea1dcf47, type: 3}
    - message: Since J is the initial letter, type it as a capital letter. Remember
        to Capitalize a letter, you have to press dot 6 before the corresponding
        letter.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f1b6c2793a1167478b5cc89455f5183, type: 3}
    - message: The word Jet ends with the rime -et.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db65b82b8a0d2f44aa0e04f50df9f5b5, type: 3}
    practiceWord: jet
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 1
    promptMessage: Can you type the word Jet?
    promptAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 81a00a930ca4f0f44b3a4a32aa9a0f68, type: 3}
    successMessage: That is Correct.
    successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe6beb06190d30148bfa826812a4af0a, type: 3}
    wrongMessage: Wrong Answer, Please Try Again.
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd615f4eef83e3b49b22a11445f9b6d6, type: 3}
    supportMessage: Remember, the word is Jet. Begin with a capital J, then type
      e, and t.
    supportAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54da8612f6c710e4db2c669b4e30ab94, type: 3}
  - title: Wet
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The next word you're going to learn is the word Wet.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59c78c0600b985c4ea0280f8cd46196d, type: 3}
    - message: Wet means something has water on it.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95aeefde9f29cfa4bb3ef649421e4444, type: 3}
    - message: The word Wet begins with the initial letter W.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 14bb3c0f7ebc6544baf44ed93e984261, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by letter e, t.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1d8ec042c8272541b3617acea1dcf47, type: 3}
